 {:seon.task/name "a-land-proves-through-the-service"
  :seon.task/plan "Measured 2026-11-14 [M, tests-3]: bin/land proves on local shards (bin/land:147, bin/prove --out --merge), outside the :process owner's admission, so three lands at once made a load of 35-49 on an 18-core machine. Until this is done root holds lands at a load over 18 by hand. The one path is Stage 1's seon_done (docs/plan.md#stage-1-claude-sessions-work-through-the-system-the-priority): a merge's prove is a :process request to the standing owner, admitted from the cores and memory like every other, and the local shard path goes with it (bin/land is frozen meanwhile: no stopgap in it). Proof: two merges asked at once never run more processes than admission grants, read from the owner's state. The merge proof, no separate main run (owner 2026-11-15; tests-4 lead with flow and data; notes tests-4-merge-proof-plan-draft-2026-11-15.md). PRIOR WORK: seon_done's path already is most of it: seon.agent/judge! (in-fork tests at the branch program), the :gate (seon.fx/run-tests, :built? for its own binary) for :deferred process tests, the candidate written from the store (seon.writer/written), seon.writer/merge-refused's :seon.merge/behind, the write-back last. Gaps: (a) one digest, the store's (seon.prove/one-digest-whichever-runner-plans-it step 2); (b) :seon.merge/unjudged: the judge stores the run-digest it proved and judged-members refuses a member whose head's run-digest differs (flow; writer.clj:229 takes heads at merge time); (c) :built? only when the candidate's binary inputs moved (seon.system/binary-current) and a deferred test reaches the binary; (d) store branch = git branch of the same name, extending seon.reconcile/write-back-target per branch (root decided); (e) a proof reads its branch's files from the store (:file/text), never the checkout's disk: round 2's agent merged a test green whose fix lived only on disk (context result/b059a5f7). Rails: can't merge behind main, a program its proof didn't see, a red at the merging head, files that don't analyze, a binary not built from its tree, outside admission. Deletes when seon_done lands real work: bin/land's merge and prove, the main-on-commit run (deleted 2026-11-16), the cron, bin/test's file-import program."
